# Absolute paths this repo publishes on purpose, one prefix per line.
# Anything else matching an absolute local path in tracked content fails
# scripts/local-path-guard.sh in CI. Prefixes are matched with forward
# slashes and collapsed separators, so one entry covers C:\x, C:\\x and C:/x.
#
# The benchmark run records keep each job's absolute sandbox path so a reader
# can line a row up against its raw stream. The author's local root was
# replaced with this neutral one, in equal-length substitutions, so every
# recorded character and token count is still the measured value - see
# benchmarks/README.md and the last amendment in benchmarks/freeze.txt.
